    "detailed_description": "<h1>WHICH EDITION IS RIGHT FOR ME?</h1><p>Depending on your history with ESO, there are two versions of Blackwood that you first need to consider:<br><br>For New ESO Players: The Elder Scrolls Online Collection: Blackwood\u2014Includes the base game, the 2021 Blackwood Chapter and ALL previous Chapters (Morrowind, Summerset, Elsweyr, and Greymoor)<br><br>For Current/Former ESO Players: The Elder Scrolls Online: Blackwood Upgrade\u2014Includes the 2021 Blackwood Chapter exclusively<br><br>The Collection is perfect if you\u2019re a new player looking to take your first steps into Tamriel, while the Upgrade is ideal for existing players who already own the base game and some (or all!) of the previous Chapters. Even better, the Collection grants new players access to the base game and previous Chapters! Even if you\u2019re an existing player, the Collection with all the previous Chapters might be a great deal for you.</p><br><h1>Collector's Edition</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400970/extras/1a7015946755fdadfec31daf43afd7f6.avif?t=1726759488\" /></div><br>Purchase The Elder Scrolls Online Collection: Blackwood CE to receive additional bonus Collector's Edition in-game content including: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Battlefield Nightmare Senche Mount  <br></li><li> Jewel-Feathered Sep Adder Pet<br></li><li> Temperamental Grimoire Memento  <br></li><li> Deadlands Gladiator Outfit Style<br></li><li> Offer Weapon Emote </li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ULTIMATE FREEDOM\u2014</h2> Create your ultimate RPG character, play solo or adventure with friends, and determine your fate in an ever-expanding world. With no level restrictions, go anywhere, at any time in a truly open world. In The Elder Scrolls Online, the choice is yours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE YOUR ADVENTURE\u2014</h2> With a new tutorial, begin your adventure where you like: emerge from Coldharbour in the Base Game, battle Dragons in the Elsweyr Chapter, or get ready to face the Prince of Destruction, Mehrunes Dagon, in Blackwood. All content is accessible for new players, and you can switch adventures whenever you like.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY BLACKWOOD CHAPTER\u2014</h2>As part of the Gates of Oblivion adventure, a deal made with the Prince of Destruction comes due in Blackwood. Explore Imperial cities and murky bogs, uncover Mehrunes Dagon's sinister plot, and never adventure alone with the Companions System.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ULTIMATE FREEDOM\u2014</h2> Create your ultimate RPG character, play solo or adventure with friends, and determine your fate in an ever-expanding world. With no level restrictions, go anywhere, at any time in a truly open world. In The Elder Scrolls Online, the choice is yours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE YOUR ADVENTURE\u2014</h2> With a new tutorial, begin your adventure where you like: emerge from Coldharbour in the Base Game, battle Dragons in the Elsweyr Chapter, or get ready to face the Prince of Destruction, Mehrunes Dagon, in Blackwood. All content is accessible for new players, and you can switch adventures whenever you like.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY BLACKWOOD CHAPTER\u2014</h2>As part of the Gates of Oblivion adventure, a deal made with the Prince of Destruction comes due in Blackwood. Explore Imperial cities and murky bogs, uncover Mehrunes Dagon's sinister plot, and never adventure alone with the Companions System.",
    "short_description": "The Elder Scrolls Online Collection: Blackwood is the ultimate Elder Scrolls experience and includes the base game, Blackwood Chapter, and all previous Chapters.",
